      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NANGAR ROOKIE (2) ran the fastest on the card last time scoring by 2 lengths (29.54) at this track. Looks to have an edge on most of these. GRAMERCY GARRY (4) has been in sparkling form, last time showing brilliant early pace and proving too slick around this track over 520m in 29.57, making it three wins on end. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Hard to fault the current string of winning form and can continue his winning ways. ZIPPING KIMELI (7) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind GRAMERCY GARRY (30.39) in a Grade 4/5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Expected to feature again. SHE'S SAINTLY (6) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at her latest outing at this circuit.",
